1. Terraform.lock.hcl -> 
                        Is the file which record the extact version of the provider 
                        plugins {AWS, GCP, AZURE}
                        
2. File structure -> 
                     terraform.tfvars --> variable.tf  --> main.tf

3. If terraform.tfvars if different ->
                     $ terraform plan -var-file ="dev.tfvars" 
                     $ terraform apply -var-file ="dev.tfvars"

4. We override configuration file by using ->
                    $ terraform plan -var "type=t2.nano"